== Introduction ==

=== Abstract ===

This document specifies <tt>cisa()</tt> and <tt>rawcisa()</tt> output script descriptors.
<tt>cisa()</tt> descriptors take a key and optionally a tree of scripts and produce a witness version 2 output script as specified in [[bip-0460.mediawiki|BIP 460]].
<tt>cisa()</tt> descriptors differ from the <tt>tr()</tt> descriptors of [[bip-0386.mediawiki|BIP 386]] only in the witness version of the output script.
<tt>rawcisa()</tt> descriptors take a single key and use it directly as the output key.

